# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, which rewrites checked-out files to
# CRLF. Device-side scripts MUST stay LF: Android/Termux `sh` fails silently on
# CRLF (it dies mid-script with no error), and that failure mode has already
# cost this campaign real runs. Pin them.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Data written and re-read by device harnesses and analyzers.
*.csv text eol=lf
